   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "AN ALBUM\n\nA notebook files things. A\npicture is a thing. So this\nis a picture album, and no\nalbum was ever written.\n\nPoint at it and press the\nleft and right arrow keys\nto turn the pages; the gold\ncorner tabs do the same."
   },
   "x": -1.45,
   "z": 2.15
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO TRY IT\n\nClick a picture on a page to\nlift it off -- it comes out\nas an ordinary pad, and the\npage is empty behind it.\nDrop it back to file it.\n\nDrop the spare picture on a\nblank page to add it.\n\nClick the SPINE and you pick\nup the album itself rather\nthan what is on its pages."
   },
   "x": -0.75,
   "z": 2.15
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "AND DUSTY\n\nWake Dusty and point him at\na page: he flies over and\ntakes that entry away.\n\nPoint him at the SPINE and\nhe takes the whole album,\nentries and all. Your own\nnotebook is the exception --\nit stays on the desk, and he\nsays so."
